# Architecture

- Views render state and forward user intent; no networking in a `View`.
- `@MainActor` view models own presentation state.
- Repository protocols describe feature data needs; implementations own I/O.
- Inject repositories through initializers so view models are testable.
- Prefer value types and structured concurrency.
- Keep feature code in `AppFeature`; the `App` target is the composition root.
- Do not add a protocol unless it is a real boundary or enables a focused test.
